  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mungaila Dairy Farmers Cooperative Milk marketing project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mungaila Dairy Farmers Cooperative Society (MDFCS) has 236 active paid up members of which 189 are male and 47 are female. While the Cooperative have access to a milk collection centre that collects the milk from members and also has access to a ready market through Parmalat the Cooperative lacks management and operational capacity to run the enterprise as a profitable and sustainable operation. The Cooperative is therefore requesting for support from USADF</narrative>
  </description>
